    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40123" root="نغب" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَبَ</span></b>  and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغُبَ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغْبٌ</span>, TA,) <i>He</i>
(a man, TA) <i>swallowed</i> saliva. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَبَ</span>,
(inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغْبٌ</span>, TA,) <i>It</i> (a bird) <i>sipped</i> water: you
do not say of a bird <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرِبَ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَبَ</span> <i>He</i> (a
man) <i>took in gulps,</i> or <i>gulped,</i> in drinking: (K:)
and likewise an ass. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغِبْتُ مِنَ الإِنَاءِ نُغَبًا</span>,
with kesr, <i>I drank in gulps from the vessel.</i>
(ISk, S.)

